    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d225">

                <pb facs="0199" n="189" sameAs="frus:frus1949v08/pg189"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.101/3–2149: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Shanghai</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Cabot</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-03-21T12:00:00+08:00">March 21,
                            1949—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received March 21—12:36 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>944. Reliably informed Mayor Wu has in fact presented resignaion and Government
                    has refused to accept it. Mayor is, however, insisting it be accepted.</p>
                <p>Sent Nanking 554, repeated Department.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cabot</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
